1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,460
Did you know?

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:04,317
Penguins can drink seawater.

3
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:07,547
For us, salt water means thirst.

4
00:00:07,797 --> 00:00:10,217
Their secret? A salt gland

5
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:12,422
right above each eye.

6
00:00:12,672 --> 00:00:15,559
It pulls salt out of the blood,

7
00:00:15,809 --> 00:00:18,416
like a tiny built-in filter.

8
00:00:18,666 --> 00:00:22,203
The salty drops drip out the nostrils,

9
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:24,874
and they sneeze them away!

10
00:00:25,124 --> 00:00:26,707
Achoo! Salt gone.

11
00:00:26,957 --> 00:00:29,750
Follow for more weird animals!

